WEBVTT

00:10:27.039 --> 00:10:31.085
that public and private investors
are aware of these opportunities

00:10:31.085 --> 00:10:32.586
across the UK.

00:10:33.545 --> 00:10:35.089
So here's the thing.

00:10:36.006 --> 00:10:38.175
Mayors, city leaders,

00:10:38.217 --> 00:10:43.931
we haven't got time for abstract debates
or merely flowery declarations.

00:10:43.931 --> 00:10:47.476
Our populations want change today.

00:10:47.518 --> 00:10:49.937
They want change yesterday.

00:10:49.937 --> 00:10:53.857
The climate crisis we're in
demands leadership.

00:10:53.899 --> 00:10:58.904
And mayors I meet around the world
are stepping up into that space

00:10:58.946 --> 00:11:00.197
to meet the moment.